# Transcription integration

Read add-ai-transcription. Test the chosen audio decoder/addon on the target host, including capture lifecycle, cancellation and reuse; do not inherit text-session support claims.

Select the installed app profile before using https://docs.qvac.tether.io/sdk/js-ts-sdk/ and https://docs.qvac.tether.io/sdk/reference/release-notes/.
